{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"abyssal_drake","model_identifier":"abyssal_drake","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# abyssal_drake\n\nAbyssal drake (C3), high flyer, 6 m (212 u) wingspan; about 5.5 m long nose to barb, 1.25 m (44 u) at the shoulder on the ground.\n\nA long, lean dragon of dark violet scales with a black dorsal ridge, glowing purple cracks along its throat, jaw and belly (glow_crack_*), a black horned crest swept back from the head, violet eyes, a long two-segment neck, bat wings with dark membranes, clawed wing thumbs and a long barbed tail. Rig: root > body > rear, neck_1 > neck_2 > head > jaw, tail_1-3, wing_* > wing_mid_* > wing_tip_*, legs leg_upper/leg_lower/paw for front_r/front_l/hind_r/hind_l.\n\n- Cubes: 53 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 256x256, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -106.0..106.0, y 0.0..58.0, z -84.0..114.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- in flight: one box 40 x 26 x 140 (w x h x d) around the body and neck (wings excluded), centred on the body; on the ground: 30 x 58 x 190\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.4 | loop |  |\n| `fly` | 1.2 | loop | slow deep wingbeats (loop) |\n| `circle` | 3.2 | loop | banked glide (loop) |\n| `breathe` | 1.6 | loop | held line breath (loop while held): flame line from fx_breath, neck arched down at the target |\n| `land` | 2 | once | from the fly pose: flare 0.45, legs reach 0.85, touchdown key 1.0 s, wings folded by 2.0 |\n| `aggro` | 2 | once | wings half spread, roar (ground) |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | recoil (ground) |\n| `death` | 2 | hold | collapses on the ground onto its side, one wing splayed; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 56.9 u/s (1.60 m/s), cycle 1.4 s, 79.6 u per cycle (it lands rarely)\n- `fly`: wingbeat 1.2 s; designed for about 10 m/s (355 u/s) cruise at height\n- `circle`: banked glide, 3.2 s loop\n\n## Key times\n\n- `land`: from the fly pose: flare 0.45, legs reach 0.85, touchdown key 1.0 s, wings folded by 2.0\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_breath` on `head` at (0, 48, -84)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Fly clips (fly, circle, breathe, land start) lift the root 3.0 u so the hanging parts clear the model origin; the game sets the real altitude.\n- `fx_breath` (snout tip, on the head bone): breath origin.\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and glow_crack_* are the lit cubes.\n"},"description":"# abyssal_drake\n\nAbyssal drake (C3), high flyer, 6 m (212 u) wingspan; about 5.5 m long nose to barb, 1.25 m (44 u) at the shoulder on the ground.\n\nA long, lean dragon of dark violet scales with a black dorsal ridge, glowing purple cracks along its throat, jaw and belly (glow_crack_*), a black horned crest swept back from the head, violet eyes, a long two-segment neck, bat wings with dark membranes, clawed wing thumbs and a long barbed tail. Rig: root > body > rear, neck_1 > neck_2 > head > jaw, tail_1-3, wing_* > wing_mid_* > wing_tip_*, legs leg_upper/leg_lower/paw for front_r/front_l/hind_r/hind_l.\n\n- Cubes: 53 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 256x256, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -106.0..106.0, y 0.0..58.0, z -84.0..114.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- in flight: one box 40 x 26 x 140 (w x h x d) around the body and neck (wings excluded), centred on the body; on the ground: 30 x 58 x 190\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.4 | loop |  |\n| `fly` | 1.2 | loop | slow deep wingbeats (loop) |\n| `circle` | 3.2 | loop | banked glide (loop) |\n| `breathe` | 1.6 | loop | held line breath (loop while held): flame line from fx_breath, neck arched down at the target |\n| `land` | 2 | once | from the fly pose: flare 0.45, legs reach 0.85, touchdown key 1.0 s, wings folded by 2.0 |\n| `aggro` | 2 | once | wings half spread, roar (ground) |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | recoil (ground) |\n| `death` | 2 | hold | collapses on the ground onto its side, one wing splayed; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 56.9 u/s (1.60 m/s), cycle 1.4 s, 79.6 u per cycle (it lands rarely)\n- `fly`: wingbeat 1.2 s; designed for about 10 m/s (355 u/s) cruise at height\n- `circle`: banked glide, 3.2 s loop\n\n## Key times\n\n- `land`: from the fly pose: flare 0.45, legs reach 0.85, touchdown key 1.0 s, wings folded by 2.0\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_breath` on `head` at (0, 48, -84)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Fly clips (fly, circle, breathe, land start) lift the root 3.0 u so the hanging parts clear the model origin; the game sets the real altitude.\n- `fx_breath` (snout tip, on the head bone): breath origin.\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and glow_crack_* are the lit cubes.\n","resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-10.0,30.0,-26.0],"to":[10.0,50.0,2.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,40.0,-4.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[220,64,240.0,84.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[164,64,192.0,84.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,86,20.0,106.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[192,64,220.0,84.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,36,20.0,64.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[20,36,40.0,64.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"2c510da1-2915-5128-b4e7-011a1155def1"},{"name":"waist","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-8.5,32.0,2.0],"to":[8.5,48.0,26.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,40.0,2.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[130,86,147.0,102.0],"te